_2_2_16_1232_1/100_a24a1a342fb4f6bd6f1d59de13e77a05.png","video":null,"cd":21.0,"cost":null,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"Burst","rgb":"199,121,85"}]}],"counters":{"assist":{"desc":"Nolan works well with Tanks that can initiate and CC the enemy so Nolan to focus on dealing as much damage as possible, such as Tigreal and Gatotkaca.","heroes":[{"id":6,"name":"Tigreal","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_8b30576754be1a4f8bebd09df8d6bec7.png"},{"id":41,"name":"Gatotkaca","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_96f9dbbc096e0f0a28f9b9e587d06a9c.png"}]},"strong":{"desc":"Nolan counters squishy heroes that lack mobility skills like Hanabi and Eudora because they have a hard time avoiding his rifts while Nolan's own mobility makes them easy targets.","heroes":[{"id":60,"name":"Hanabi","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_8a9c1966feb34e85d7bdcc1ed01ffb5d.png"},{"id":15,"name":"Eudora","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_87b2a655b254c136dce8976e21935a80.png"}]},"weak":{"desc":"Nolan is countered by tanky heroes with high sustained damage, such as Thamuz and Fredrinn, who can survive Nolan's burst and kill him afterwards.","heroes":[{"id":72,"name":"Thamuz","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_b5ad55e408b68acf6a86e7ff76f5f569.png"},{"id":117,"name":"Fredrinn","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_dea170bfd5f26c41fb04e5edf72afedb.png"}]}},"official_url":"https://play.mobilelegends.com/lore/hero/Nolan","skins":[{"name":"Cosmic Wayfinder","name_slug":"Cosmic-Wayfinder","image":"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/nolan/Nolan-Cosmic-Wayfinder-20231008062052.webp","image_filename":"Nolan-Cosmic-Wayfinder-20231008062052.webp","released":"2023-10-08","is_original":true},{"name":